---

Why This Is Efficient

Instead of:

JD
 ├─ Summary
 ├─ Mirror
 ├─ Path
 ├─ Description
 ├─ File List
 ├─ References
 ├─ Links

You get:

JD
 └─ JNL

And JNL resolves everything else.


---

JNL as a Universal Pointer

The architecture becomes:

JD
 ↓
JNL
 ↓
LAL
 ↓
Actual Assets

Meaning:

JD explains

JNL identifies

LAL locates

Yggdrasil stores


Each system has a single responsibility.


